{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try your hand at running your very own gun center!</h2>Step into the world of firearms retail with the free demo of Gun Center Simulator. Experience the thrill of managing your own store, serving a variety of customers, and testing out your favorite weapons on the shooting range \u2013 all in this exclusive demo version!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/05.Gun_Center_Simulator.gif?t=1749041421\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your First Gun Shop in the Demo Version</h2>Get a taste of entrepreneurship as you open the doors to your very first gun center. Organize a limited selection of pistols, shotguns, and rifles on your shelves. Learn the basics of inventory management and discover how to present your products to attract new customers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/01.Gun_Center_Simulator.gif?t=1749041421\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Serve Your First Customers</h2>Meet a range of demo customers, from curious hobbyists to experienced hunters. Listen to their requests, recommend the right firearms, and make your first sales. Can you satisfy their needs and build your reputation?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/02.Gun_Center_Simulator.gif?t=1749041421\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Skills on the Shooting Range</h2>Take any weapon from your demo inventory and head to the fully equipped shooting range. Try out different firearms, experience realistic shooting mechanics, and see how each gun handles. Will you master the targets and unlock bonus rewards?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/03.Gun_Center_Simulator.gif?t=1749041421\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize and Upgrade Limited in the Demo Version</h2>Personalize your store with a selection of demo d\u00e9cor and basic upgrades. Rearrange your displays, improve the look of your gun racks, and see how small changes can make a big difference in attracting customers.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/04.Gun_Center_Simulator.gif?t=1749041421\" /><br><br>Get an early feel in the Demo Version for the core gameplay loop of managing, selling, and shooting.<br><br>Your Feedback Matters for us - help shape the future of Gun Center Simulator by sharing your thoughts and feedback!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take your first shot at becoming the ultimate gun center owner in the fee Demo Version.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618220?t=1749041421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618220?t=1749041421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/e8c73276b3a5cfbe2890c7c34075bc49fa9cc3e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749041421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/e8c73276b3a5cfbe2890c7c34075bc49fa9cc3e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749041421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try your hand at running your very own gun center!</h2>Step into the world of firearms retail with the free demo of Gun Center Simulator. Experience the thrill of managing your own store, serving a variety of customers, and testing out your favorite weapons on the shooting range \u2013 all in this exclusive demo version!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618220/extras/05.Gun_Center_Simulator.g